{"id":"a4f89e53-652b-45dd-9cfa-d40ea54aa7f6","slug":"ig30codm","model":"IG30CODM","name":"IG30CODM 有色溶解性有机物传感器","shortDescription":"通过紫外荧光原理监测水体中的有色溶解性有机物，适用于江河湖泊、地下水及废水监测。紧凑探头结合自动清洁刷与数字通讯，便于长期在线布设。","featured":false,"category":{"slug":"water","brand":null,"name":"水质分析","description":null,"seo":{"title":"水质分析","description":null,"imageUrl":null,"index":true}},"heroImage":{"id":"e9c2938f-6236-4c7f-bf9d-752bcf98b444","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"2025040861512869.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":13520,"sha256":"3a4bd3a9ba0af3bd90061177b116d1a851d9d410ca383514dfbd7fdb3aa5270f","width":540,"height":540,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/3a4bd3a9ba0af3bd90061177.jpg","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.805Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":320,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/9fb61c06fe27bcc0e9cecfd6.webp"},{"width":540,"height":540,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/b63396be40013d2d55e983f5.webp"}]},"detailLayout":"STRUCTURED","availableLocales":["zh-CN","de","en"],"description":null,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><span>产品特点：</span></strong></p><p>◆传感器，采用紫外荧光分析法原理，专门检测水体的有色可溶解性有机物</p><p>◆适用于江河湖泊的有色可溶解性有机物的测量，具有灵敏度高，体积小、带自动清洁刷等特点，适合长期在线监测</p><p>◆应用于环境监测，地下水监测，海洋研究，废水处理等领域</p><p>◆RS485输出，支持MODBUS，可轻松集成于水质监测系统，满足客户需求</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>应用领域：</span></strong></p><p>环境监测、地下水监测、海洋研究、废水处理</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>技术参数：</span></strong></p><p>测量范围：0-400ppb</p><p>测量原理：紫外荧光法</p><p>测量精度： 读数的± 3%</p><p>重复性：小于±3% </p><p>检测限：0.1 ppb</p><p>响应时间：4s</p><p>线性度：R2＞0.999（标液连续稀释）</p><p>水样需求：流速：0-3m/s;压力：0-100Psi；0-6bar;温度：0-50℃</p><p>通讯接口：ModbusRS485</p><p>螺纹接口：标准3/4NPT</p><p>防护等级：IP68</p><p>安装方式：投入式、流通式</p><p>线缆长度：标准10m，可延长</p><p>传感器材料：316L</p><p>电极尺寸：190mm*46 mm</p><br />\n    ","gallery":[],"features":[],"specificationGroups":[{"name":"技术参数","specifications":[{"key":"measurement-range","label":"测量范围","value":"0-400ppb","unit":null},{"key":"measurement-principle","label":"测量原理","value":"紫外荧光法","unit":null},{"key":"accurac